# Efficient Diff Algorithm

## Overview
This project implements an efficient diff algorithm for comparing two sequences of data and identifying differences.

## Features
- Fast comparison of text or data sequences
- Generates detailed diff output showing additions, deletions, and modifications
- Optimized for performance on large datasets
- Clean and intuitive API

## Usage
```
// Example usage
diff(sequence1, sequence2)
```

## Algorithm
The implementation uses optimized techniques to efficiently identify the minimal set of changes needed to transform one sequence into another.

## Performance
- Time Complexity: O(n*m) worst case, optimized for common cases
- Space Complexity: O(n+m)

